1.prototype pattern
-------------------


original object created with parameter



clone object created with empty parameter but original object to set the values for clone object




without prototype pattern
-------------------------

1.private variables unable to access outside of the class

2.individual fields clone is difficult compared to all the fields once


with prototype pattern
----------------------

1.only original object created with parameter

2.clone reference just assign by using (Student) obj.clone();


Why Prototype interface with clone method
-----------------------------------------

->without interface,everyone use different method name then there is consistency issue 

->with interface,everyone use same method name then there is no consistency issue


public interface Prototype
{
	Prototype clone();
}


